       EVP_KEYEXCH-DH - DH Key Exchange algorithm support

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       Key exchange support for the DDHH key type.

   DDHH kkeeyy eexxcchhaannggee ppaarraammeetteerrss
       "pad" (OOSSSSLL__EEXXCCHHAANNGGEE__PPAARRAAMM__PPAADD) <unsigned integer>
           Sets the padding mode for the associated key exchange ctx.  Setting
           a  value of 1 will turn padding on.  Setting a value of 0 will turn
           padding off.  If padding is off then the derived shared secret  may
           be smaller than the largest possible secret size.  If padding is on
           then  the  derived  shared  secret will have its first bytes filled
           with zeros where necessary to make the shared secret the same  size
           as the largest possible secret size.  The padding mode parameter is
           ignored  (and  padding implicitly enabled) when the KDF type is set
           to "X942KDF-ASN1" (OOSSSSLL__KKDDFF__NNAAMMEE__XX994422KKDDFF__AASSNN11).

